      <title>China! We’ve added a Beijing show to our tour next month. We’ll be at @vas_live…</title>
      <link>https://www.instagram.com/p/DdXTYrFhODS/</link>
      <description>China! We’ve added a Beijing show to our tour next month. We’ll be at @vas_live_official Shanghai on 23 Oct and OMNISPACE Beijing on 25 Oct. It’s our first visit to China and we’d love to see you. Especially if you are a panda. But humans also are welcome.

Tickets for both shows go on sale this Fri 18 Sep at 12PM China Standard Time 🇨🇳

中国的朋友们！我们下个月的巡演新增了一场北京站演出。我们将于 10 月 23 日在上海 VAS Live 演出，并于 10 月 25 日在北京 OMNISPACE 演出。这是我们首次来华，非常期待见到大家——尤其是如果你是只熊猫的话（当然，人类朋友我们也同样欢迎）。

